G2228.def:
**ἤ**,
_disjunctive and comparative particle_ (Bl., §36, 12; 77, 11);
1. disjunctive, **or**;
(a) **between single words**: [[Mat.5.17|Mat.5:17]] [[Mrk.6.56|Mrk.6:56]], [[Luk.2.24|Luk.2:24]], [[Jhn.6.19|Jhn.6:19]], [[Rom.1.21|Rom.1:21]], al.;
(b) before a sentence expressing a variation, denial or refutation of a previous statement, frequently in interrog. form: [[Mat.7.4|Mat.7:4]], 9 [[Mrk.12.14|Mrk.12:14]], [[Luk.13.4|Luk.13:4]], [[Rom.3.29; 6.3; 9.21|Rom.3:29 6:3 9:21]], [[1Co.6.9|1Co.6:9]], 16 9:6, [[2Co.11.7|2Co.11:7]] ἤ . . . ἤ, **either . . . or**, [[Mat.6.24|Mat.6:24]], [[Luk.16.13|Luk.16:13]], [[1Co.14.6|1Co.14:6]];
(with) **in a disjunctive question **(as Lat. an after utrum): [[Mat.9.5|Mat.9:5]], [[Mrk.2.9|Mrk.2:9]], [[Luk.7.19|Luk.7:19]], al.; after πότερον, [[Jhn.7.17|Jhn.7:17]] μή, [[1Co.9.8|1Co.9:8]] μήτι, [[2Co.1.17|2Co.1:17]] ἤ . . . ἤ . . . ἤ, [[Mrk.13.35|Mrk.13:35]]
2. Comparative, **than**: after comparatives, [[Mat.10.15|Mat.10:15]], [[Luk.9.13|Luk.9:13]], [[Jhn.3.19|Jhn.3:19]], [[Rom.13.11|Rom.13:11]], al.; after ἕτερον, [[Act.17.21|Act.17:21]] θέλω (Khüner 3, iv, 303), [[1Co.14.19|1Co.14:19]] πρὶν ἤ, **before**, before accusative and inf., [[Mat.1.18|Mat.1:18]] [[Mrk.14.30|Mrk.14:30]]; after a positive adj. ([[Gen.49.12|Gen.49:12]] cf. Robertson, _Gr._, 661), [[Mat.18.8|Mat.18:8]], 9 [[Mrk.9.43, 45|Mrk.9:43, 45]] 47.
3. **with other particles**: ἀλλ᾽ ἤ, see: ἀλλά; ἤ γάρ, see: γάρ; ἢ καί, **or even, or also**, [[Mat.7.10|Mat.7:10]], [[Luk.11.11, 12|Luk.11:11, 12]] [[Rom.2.15; 4.9|Rom.2:15 4:9]], al; ἤτοι . . . ἤ, [[Rom.6.16|Rom.6:16]] (cf. [[Wis.11.19|Wis.11:19]]).
(AS)

